  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When eight desolate beasts form an encirclement from Dang Hun Mountain, azure dragon vine is named with ice spike divine ape, phoenix feather lava crocodile, and golden sand dark stallion among them.",
      "chapters": [
        700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "among-eight-desolate-beasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The south side is entrenched by an azure dragon vine. Strictly speaking it is not a wild beast but a plant. Its vines have condensed into a dragon shape. With roots pierced into the soil, its defensive and regenerative powers are extremely terrifying, so it specializes in battles of attrition. If it pulls out the roots, it can soar in the sky like an azure dragon.",
      "chapters": [
        701
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "plant-in-dragon-shape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan returns to the land spirit the eight desolate beasts that were lent out, naming azure dragon vine with ice spike divine ape, phoenix feather lava crocodile, golden sand dark stallion, swamp crab, peach wolf, iron crown eagle, and earth chief desolate beast, without a single scratch.",
      "chapters": [
        708
